    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 748 of the laws of 1991, amending the environmental conservation law and various other laws relating to establishing the Hudson river valley greenway, in relation to extending the expiration of certain provisions relating to indemnity to communities",
    "basePrintNo": "S7106",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7106-2011",
